description:
Implement the iterative refinement loop: extract → validate → correct → validate.

## Files to Modify
- `src/Service/Agent/AgentCoordinator.ts`

## Implementation
```typescript
refineUntilConformant: (config: RefinementConfig) =>
  Effect.gen(function*() {
    let graph = yield* extractor.execute(text)
    let iterations = 0

    while (iterations < config.maxIterations) {
      const report = yield* validator.execute(graph)

      if (report.conforms) {
        return { graph, iterations, status: "conformant" }
      }

      // Correct violations
      graph = yield* corrector.correctAll(report, graph)
      iterations++

      // Emit progress
      yield* emit({ _tag: "Progress", iteration: iterations })
    }

    return { graph, iterations, status: "max-iterations-reached" }
  })
```

## Configuration
```typescript
interface RefinementConfig {
  maxIterations: number      // Max correction attempts
  stopOnConformance: boolean // Stop when all violations fixed
  minConfidence: number      // Stop if confidence drops
  checkpointInterval: number // Save state every N iterations
}
```

